     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "What affects the cost of building an app?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "The weeks of engineering. The calculator starts from a base for your build stage (about 4 weeks for an MVP, 8 for market-ready, 14 for scale or enterprise), adds weeks for each feature and for the backend you choose, then adjusts for platforms and design depth. Payments, chat, maps, offline sync, AI integration and an admin dashboard each add real weeks; accounts and push notifications are comparatively cheap."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "How accurate is the app cost estimate?",
