     "t": "p",
     "html": "Every app estimate comes down to the weeks of engineering multiplied by a rate. The calculator starts from a base for your build stage, adds weeks for each feature and for the backend you choose, then adjusts for platforms and design depth. The result is an indicative range in weeks and US dollars."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "Want the detail? Read <a href=\"/blog/app-cost-estimator\">how an app cost estimator works</a>, compare <a href=\"/blog/mobile-app-cost-examples\">three worked examples</a>, or see the specifics for <a href=\"/blog/react-native-app-development-cost\">React Native</a>, <a href=\"/blog/app-development-cost-india\">India</a>, <a href=\"/blog/android-app-development-cost\">Android</a> and <a href=\"/blog/mvp-app-development-guide\">MVPs</a>."
