      {
       "q": "How accurate is the app cost estimate?",
       "a": "It is an indicative planning range, not a quote. Your exact fixed price is confirmed after a short discovery call once requirements are clear. Our guide to <a href=\"/blog/app-cost-estimator\">how an app cost estimator works</a> explains the method."
      },
      {
       "q": "Is it cheaper to build only for iOS or only for Android?",
       "a": "Slightly. A single platform is about 10 percent less than building both from one shared codebase, because most of the work is shared. See <a href=\"/blog/android-app-development-cost\">Android app development cost</a>."
      },
      {
       "q": "How much does it cost to add AI features to an app?",
       "a": "AI integration adds about 3 weeks of engineering in the calculator, on top of the base for your build stage. See <a href=\"/blog/ai-app-development-cost-2026\">how much it costs to build an AI app</a> for the detail."
