      {
       "q": "How long does it take to build an app?",
       "a": "In our model a lean MVP is about 7 weeks and a market-ready product about 25 weeks. See <a href=\"/blog/how-long-to-build-an-app\">how long it takes to build a mobile app</a> and <a href=\"/blog/mobile-app-cost-examples\">three worked examples with real numbers</a>."
